## User-specific Xcode state — the shared scheme in xcshareddata/ is committed.
xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## Signing — never commit these. Xcode generates the app's entitlements file
## when you add the HealthKit capability; it's specific to your team.
*.mobileprovision
*.p12
*.certSigningRequest

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Models — on-demand resources for the local LLM layer, if you add one.
*.mlpackage
*.mlmodelc
*.safetensors
*.gguf

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
